# E-Commerce Backend Authentication System

## Overview

This project implements a production-ready authentication system using:

- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB
- ES6 Modules
- JWT (Access + Refresh Token Architecture)

The system follows MVC architecture and includes multiple security layers.

---

## Features

### Authentication
- User Registration
- User Login
- Access Token (15 minutes)
- Refresh Token (7 days)
- Secure Logout

### Security Layers
- Input Validation (express-validator)
- Global Rate Limiting
- Login Rate Limiting
- Account Locking after failed attempts
- Password Hashing using bcrypt
- httpOnly Cookie protection
- Role-based Authorization (User/Admin)

---

## JWT Architecture

### Access Token
- Short-lived (15m)
- Sent in JSON response
- Used for protected routes

### Refresh Token
- Long-lived (7d)
- Stored in httpOnly cookie
- Used to generate new access tokens

